<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Young Pokéathlete!\nWassup!\r...\rRunnin’ outta energy?\nWassup, again!\rGood!\nMy name Maximo!\rI’m the Pokéathlon MC!\nNice to meet you!\rI got you whenever you\nneed to know anythin’ about\fthe Pokéathlon.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Maximo: Wassup!\rI got you whenever you\nneed to know anythin’ about\fthe Pokéathlon.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You got questions? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Which course you wanna\nknow about? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Which event you wanna\nknow about? {YESNO 0}</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lemme explain the Pokéathlon!\rIt’s the connection between homies\nand Pokéathletes.\rIt’s FRIENDSHIP itself!\n...What?\rYou don’t get it?\nOK. I’ll say more this time.\rYou build a team of three\nhomies to compete in ten\fdifferent events!\rThe bond between homies and\nPokéathletes get tested!\rThat’s what we call friendship!\nYou feel me?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lemme explain “Hurdle Dash.”\nIt’s a event that test your speed.\rYour homie gotta jump\nwhen the Hurdle get close.\rIf it jump at the right time,\nit clear the Hurdle!\rThe total time of the three homies\ngive you the event score.\rThis a event for speedy homies\nthat move quick like me!\rYou feel me?\rAight, any more questions?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lemme explain “Pennant Capture.”\r Your homies grab Pennants on\nthe beach.\rGrabbin’ Pennants don’t add to\nyour score.\rYou gotta come back with\nthe Pennants.\rThis a event for speedy and skilled\nhomies that move like I do!\rYou feel me?\rAight, any more questions?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lemme explain “Circle Push.”\nYour homies push others to try\fand stay in a Circle.\rYou get points as long as your\nhomies stay in a Circle.\rThe total time of the three homies\ngive your score.\rThis a event for strong homies\nwith stamina that’s strong like me!\rYou feel me?\rAight, any more questions?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lemme explain “Block Smash.”\nYou smash Blocks, like it say.\rHow many Blocks you smash\nis the score you get.\rIt’s SO simple, ain’t it?\rThis a event for strong homies\nthat’s strong like me!\rYou feel me?\rAight, any more questions?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lemme explain “Disc Catch.”\nYour homies jump and catch\fDiscs flyin’ at ’em.\rThe longer you wait before they catch\nthe Discs, the more points you get.\fThe total points decide the score.\rThis a event for strong and jumpy\nhomies that move like me!\rYou feel me?\nAight, any other questions?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lemme explain “Lamp Jump.”\nYour homies bounce to jump high\fand touch as many Lamps as they can.\rThe more Lamps they touch, the more\npoints you get.\rThe total points decide the score.\rThis a event for jumpy homies\nthat’s jumpy like me!\rYou feel me?\rAight, any more questions?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lemme explain “Relay Run.”\nYour homies take turns runnin’ as far\fas they can in 90 seconds.\rThe distance of the Relay decide\nthe score.\rThis a event for speedy homies\nwith stamina... Just like me!\rYou feel me?\rAight, any more questions?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lemme explain “Ring Drop.”\nYour homies try to knock other\fhomies outta the Ring.\rA tackle get you one point.\nStompin’ on another homie\fget you two points.\rIf your homies knock another homie\noff the Ring, you get\ften points.\rThis a event for homies with\nstamina just like I got!\rYou feel me?\nAight, any more questions?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00014" index="14">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lemme explain “Snow Throw.”\nSnow Throw might not ring a bell...\fhow ’bout a Snowball fight?\rThe more your homies hit other\nhomies with Snow, the higher the\fscore.\rThis a event for strong and\nskilled homies... Just like me!\rYou feel me?\rAight, any more questions?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00015" index="15">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Lemme explain “Goal Roll.”\nYour homies try to roll the ball into\fthe Goals of the other teams.\rMost balls get you one point.\rGold balls get you\ntwo points.\rThe points decide your rank,\nand that decide the score.\rThis a event for strong and\nskilled homies... Just like me!\rYou feel me?\rAight, any more questions?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00016" index="16">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Young Pokéathlete!\rDon’t forget your Pokéathlon\nstretches before you work out!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00017" index="17">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Me? You interested in me?\nHahaha!\fOh, don’t be shy.\rSome people call me “big bro”!\rBut deadass, the big bro is...\n...\f...\fmy twin brother!\rThe “big bro,” like they say, is\ndeadass the lil bro.\rSo this “big bro” got a\nbigger bro...\rYou feel me?\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00018" index="18">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">RATTATA: Ratta.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00019" index="19">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">RATTATA: Grrrr.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00020" index="20">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MACHOP: Awwwrr...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00021" index="21">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">MACHOP: Yahhh!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00022" index="22">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">BUTTERFREE: Fluttah fluttah...</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00023" index="23">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">BUTTERFREE: Bing bing!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00024" index="24">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The Pokéathlon all about scores.\rNobody know who finna win\ntill the hella last second!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00025" index="25">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pokéathlete {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0} is\nalways fire!\rI can’t take my eyes off\nthat Pokéathlete!\r...\nWait... Sheesh! Is that deadass you?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00026" index="26">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aprijuice for the W!\rYour homies can show their\ntrue Performance potential!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00027" index="27">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Aprijuice for the W!\rWhat drink you use,\nPokéathlete {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rI’mma buy what you buy!\fI’m a big fan!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00028" index="28">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Er... I...I’mma try to win every\ncourse with MAGIKARP!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00029" index="29">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Pokéathlete {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rEr... How...how I win every\ncourse with MAGIKARP?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00030" index="30">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’mma break my personal record\nat Hurdle Dash!\rAight, which homie should\nI pick...?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00031" index="31">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Y-y-you Pokéathlete {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rI got no clue how I could ever\nget where you at!\fYou ARE the Pokéathlon!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00032" index="32">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Sheesh!\nThat guy over there is Magnus,\fthe Pokéathlon owner!\rI heard he beat a MACHAMP at\narm wrestlin’ once. Could it be true?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00033" index="33">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yikes!\nPokéathlete {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rI’m a HUGE fan!\nOh my...what do I do?\fCan I get a autograph?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00034" index="34">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Arrgh!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00035" index="35">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Arrgh!\nPokéathlete {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rYou make me feel young again!\fI’m rootin’ for you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00036" index="36">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yeek!!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00037" index="37">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh my!\nIt’s Pokéathlete {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rYou look just like my son.\fI’m rootin’ for you.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00038" index="38">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Oh my!\nIt’s Pokéathlete {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rYou look just like my daughter.\fI’m rootin’ for you.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00039" index="39">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My boyfriend a Pokéathlete.\rBut he so shy about it that I root\nfor him behind a column so he\fdon’t see me!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00040" index="40">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Don’t he look so fine drippin’\nsweat just like his homies?\rNot that he even compare to the great\nPokéathlete {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}, though.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00041" index="41">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Do the Pokéathlon to\nrelieve stress.\fThat’s the move!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00042" index="42">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Don’t you EVER underestimate your mom.\nThe look on her face when she was\fhaglin’ at a sale...\rStill gimme chills!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00043" index="43">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Every dad wanna be a hero to\ntheir son.\rThe Pokéathlon...\nShould I take it up?\rJust watch, Son!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00044" index="44">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Ahh... My son!\nThat hurt to hear.\rLemme hear you say you wanna be\nlike your dad...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00045" index="45">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">My mom FINALLY enterin’.\rI was gettin’ worried ’cause she\nnever work out.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00046" index="46">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’mma grow up to be a great\nPokéathlete like you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00047" index="47">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m cheerin’ for you!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00048" index="48">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You Pokéathlete {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rFor real?\nI can’t believe it!\n</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00049" index="49">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I’m watchin’ real close!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00050" index="50">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You Pokéathlete {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}?\rTap... Tap... Tap...\rI can’t believe it! I touched my hero!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00051" index="51">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">I ain’t expect this many old\nladies like me to be competin’.\fMaybe I can join ’em.\rIt might be my chance to get close to\nmy hero--Pokéathlete Jet!\fHahaha!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0139_D49R0102_00052" index="52">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Yeek!!\rPokéathlete {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nEvery time you in the game,\fmy daughters’ eyes stay glued!\rCould I get a autograph?\f...No no!\rNot for me. It’s for my daughters.\nHa ha!</language>
	</row>
</body>
